{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rA6kkfENwn1793004952.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>塞爾維亞周日國會選舉，掌權十多年、角逐總理的武契奇，敗給新冒起的反對派「學生名單」。上周四約15萬民眾，在首都貝爾格萊德集會，為「學生名單」造勢，希望將武契奇及執政進步黨趕下台。</p><p></p><p>「學生名單」由學者和年輕人主導組成，組織較鬆散，聲稱沒有領袖，派出250人參選，大多來自學術界和其他專業界別，競逐國會全部250席。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_20261026_QQ.SER.STUDENT.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TsgxHmG18R1793005098.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>分析認為這場學生運動持續得到民眾支持，聲勢前所未有，更為武契奇超過14年執政生涯劃上句號。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_20261026_QQ.SER.STUDENT.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PSIZj2OLlJ1793005160.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>這場學生運動源於2024年11月，全國第二大城市諾維薩德的火車站，翻新不久後混凝土簷篷倒塌，造成16人死亡的事故。</p><p></p><p>民眾質疑工程偷工減料和官員腐敗，引發全國連場示威和罷工，要求追究相關責任。</p><p></p><p>總理武切維奇其後呈辭，建設部長等11人涉貪被捕，武契奇更在今年9月解散國會，辭去總統提早大選，都未能平息民怨。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/10409-2026%E5%B9%B4%E6%B3%95%E6%B2%BB%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:01.982255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.468135+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:10.976860+00:00","content_hash":"85c274d32165375778de0f804364ccb01bee4af6a032b7766f5b81bf2d1622eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:01.982255+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}